{"version":1,"content":"<p>超過500名Google員工及承包商日前聯名請願，要求Google允許K-12學校在不使用人工智能功能的情況下繼續使用Google搜索。這份請願書面向Google行政總裁桑達爾·皮查伊、搜索業務負責人伊麗莎白·裏德以及教育業務負責人克裏斯·菲利普斯，由代表Alphabet及其子公司全職員工、臨時工、供應商和承包商的Alphabet員工工會組織發起。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587216.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.936167+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:12:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"07a7ceeacbcc1b24ae0f86c39046391ebff87c4efb772d07979493739947ce99","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}